00:04:53.926 --> 00:04:57.663 line:0%
That's $15.99 if you want the
full -- if you want to Vroom.

00:04:57.663 --> 00:05:01.433 line:0%
Right now you're Zooming.
I want to Vroom! Yeah.

00:05:01.433 --> 00:05:04.770 line:0%
This one's from @Hannahzylstra.

00:05:04.770 --> 00:05:06.539 line:0%
Zylstra?

00:05:06.539 --> 00:05:08.207 line:0%
"My mom now ends
our conversations with,

00:05:08.207 --> 00:05:11.877 line:0%
'Love you, drive safe,
and don't lick anything.'"

00:05:11.877 --> 00:05:15.781 line:0%
Okay. Thanks, Mom. Thanks, Mom.

00:05:15.781 --> 00:05:18.618 line:0%
I won't lick anything.
Thank you.

00:05:18.618 --> 00:05:20.986 line:0%
This one's from @amandathinks13.

00:05:20.986 --> 00:05:24.756 line:0%
Her mom said, "I heard Gigi and
Hadid are going to be parents.

00:05:24.756 --> 00:05:26.492 line:0%
Good for them."

00:05:26.492 --> 00:05:30.696 line:0%
[ Laughs ]

00:05:30.696 --> 00:05:33.032 line:0%
"Gigi and Hadid."

00:05:33.032 --> 00:05:36.735 line:0%
[ Chuckles ]

00:05:36.735 --> 00:05:39.038 line:0%
This one is from @mbodyspirit.

00:05:39.038 --> 00:05:41.707 line:0%
They say, "Yes, you can
keep using the iPad.

00:05:41.707 --> 00:05:45.812 line:0%
Please keep using the iPad."

00:05:45.812 --> 00:05:47.479 line:0%
That's a mom that needs a break.

00:05:47.479 --> 00:05:49.215 line:0%
These are #QuarantineMomQuotes.

00:05:49.215 --> 00:05:50.783 line:0%
This one's from @teachnwolves.

00:05:50.783 --> 00:05:55.521 line:0%
She says, "We are rationing
the Cool Whip."

00:05:55.521 --> 00:05:57.289 line:0%
"Hey!"

00:05:57.289 --> 00:05:59.292 line:0%
[ Laughs ]

00:05:59.292 --> 00:06:01.994 line:0%
"Hey! We're rationing
the Cool Whip, okay?

00:06:01.994 --> 00:06:06.666 line:0%
One dollop.
One flop on each dessert."

00:06:09.068 --> 00:06:13.739 line:0%
This one's from @thechap9.

00:06:13.739 --> 00:06:18.210 line:0%
They say -- "Mom said,
your dad is your parent now."

00:06:18.210 --> 00:06:21.046 line:0%
"Your dad is
your parent now, okay?

00:06:21.046 --> 00:06:22.548 line:0%
I had enough, okay?

00:06:22.548 --> 00:06:26.652 line:0%
Had enough of you, so your dad
is your parent now, okay?"

00:06:26.652 --> 00:06:28.587 line:0%
These are #QuarantineMomQuotes.

00:06:28.587 --> 00:06:32.491 line:0%
This one's from @countbasic2.
He says -- His mom said --

00:06:32.491 --> 00:06:35.761 line:0%
[ Laughs ]

00:06:35.761 --> 00:06:37.863 line:0%
"I've been watching
that Amazon show

00:06:37.863 --> 00:06:40.532 line:0%
