'Scumball.'"

00:06:40.532 --> 00:06:44.202 line:0%
[ Laughs ]

00:06:44.202 --> 00:06:46.538 line:0%
"You mean 'Fleabag.'"

00:06:46.538 --> 00:06:51.543 line:0%
Yeah. It's not "Scumball."

00:06:51.543 --> 00:06:55.213 line:0%
[ Laughs ]

00:06:55.213 --> 00:06:58.217 line:0%
This one's from @lckcvmj.

00:06:58.217 --> 00:07:01.020 line:0%
She says her mom said,
"I'm not an angry person.

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:04.323 line:0%
You guys just make me angry."

00:07:04.323 --> 00:07:07.460 line:0%
"Simple as that.
I'm not an angry person."

00:07:07.460 --> 00:07:10.496 line:0%
This last one's from
@herndongearis.

00:07:10.496 --> 00:07:14.867 line:0%
He says his mom says,
"Dinner is poured."

00:07:14.867 --> 00:07:17.136 line:0%
There you guys have it.
Those are our hashtags.

00:07:17.136 --> 00:07:18.671 line:0%
Happy Mother's Day, everybody.

00:07:18.671 --> 00:07:20.205 line:0%
We'll be right back
with more "Tonight Show."

00:07:20.205 --> 00:07:23.075
Queen Latifah, Judd Apatow,
Pete Davidson, James Taylor.

00:07:23.075 --> 00:07:25.010
Come on back, everybody.

00:07:25.010 --> 00:07:28.781
♪♪

00:07:28.781 --> 00:07:31.384
-I want to pitch!

00:07:31.384 --> 00:07:33.419
