00:07:33.419 --> 00:07:39.458
♪♪

00:07:39.458 --> 00:07:42.929
-Yes!
-Ohh!

00:07:42.929 --> 00:07:45.064
Franny, What are you doing?

00:07:45.064 --> 00:07:49.001
♪♪

00:07:49.001 --> 00:07:50.736
-Powerhouse.

00:07:50.736 --> 00:07:56.509
♪♪

00:07:56.509 --> 00:08:00.746
[ Laughter ]

